# Deep Sea & Arthropod Action Descriptions
morphext.metamorph.desc.spider_leap=Spider Leap: Leap violently forward along your crosshair, flying through the air to deliver impact damage and knockback upon landing, 3s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.prismarine_laser=Prismarine Laser: Charge for 0.4s with pitch-rising audio, then unleash a piercing beam of prismarine energy that deals massive bonus damage to wet/underwater targets, 4s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.elder_curse=Elder Curse: Unleash ancient ocean monument dread, inflicting Mining Fatigue III for 15s, Slowness II, and Weakness on nearby foes while casting the iconic ghost apparition on screen, 13s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.shulker_bullet=Shulker Bullet: Launch a homing missile toward targets or crosshair, dealing damage and inflicting 10s Levitation. Safe forward spawn offset avoids self-hits, 3.5s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.shulker_shell=Shell Armor: Hunker down inside your purpur shell, gaining Resistance IV (80% reduction) and Slowness IV for 5s, 9s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ink_jet=Ink Jet: Squirt a dense cloud of blinding black ink that blinds and slows surrounding enemies, while jetting forward with recoil propulsion, 4s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.heavy_toss=Heavy Toss: Deliver a devastating upward swing with your iron arms, dealing heavy damage and launching foes high into the air, 3s cooldown.

# Deep Sea & Arthropod Passives
morphext.passive.thorns.name=Prismarine Spikes
morphext.passive.thorns.desc=Reflect piercing thorns damage back to melee attackers upon being hit.
morphext.passive.web_immunity.name=Web Immunity
morphext.passive.web_immunity.desc=Completely unaffected by cobweb drag, moving through spider webs at full speed.
morphext.passive.cave_spider_poison.name=Deadly Venom
morphext.passive.cave_spider_poison.desc=Inflict deadly Poison II for 7s on targets hit by your melee attacks.
morphext.passive.shulker_defense.name=Shulker Shell Defense
morphext.passive.shulker_defense.desc=Sneak to close shell for +20 Armor and deflect all projectiles; 25% chance to teleport on hit when below 50% HP.
morphext.passive.squid_swim.name=Tentacle Propulsion
morphext.passive.squid_swim.desc=Gain rhythmic tentacle pulses in water; squirt defensive ink and gain escape acceleration when hit in water.
morphext.passive.iron_golem_nature.name=Titanic Iron Nature
morphext.passive.iron_golem_nature.desc=Gain 100% knockback resistance and immunity to drowning, falling, and cacti; melee hits toss enemies into the air.
morphext.passive.iron_knockback_res.name=Steadfast Iron
morphext.passive.iron_knockback_res.desc=Armored iron body grants 100% knockback resistance.

# End and Nether Boss Actions
morphext.metamorph.action.dragon_breath=Dragon Breath
morphext.metamorph.desc.dragon_breath=Dragon Breath: Spout a high-velocity ender dragon fireball that erupts into lingering hazardous purple clouds of Instant Damage II upon impact. Safe forward offset 3.5m prevents self-hits, 5s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.dragon_wing_flap=Wing Flap Gust
morphext.metamorph.desc.dragon_wing_flap=Wing Flap Gust: Flap dragon wings violently to unleash concussive wind pressure, knocking back and launching nearby enemies within 10m high into the air with 8 slashing damage, 7s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.dragon_dive=Dive Bomb Strike
morphext.metamorph.desc.dragon_dive=Dive Bomb Strike: Dive-bomb forward along crosshairs with terrifying momentum, dealing 16 armor-bypassing piercing impact damage and heavy knockback along your path with full fall immunity, 10s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.wither_skull=Wither Skull
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_skull=Wither Skull: Fire a high-explosive black wither skull from the main center head along crosshairs, dealing blast damage and inflicting wither. Safe forward offset 2.0m prevents self-hits, 2.5s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.wither_blue_skull=Dual Blue Skulls
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_blue_skull=Dual Blue Skulls: Simultaneously fire tracking blue invulnerable wither skulls from both left and right heads, locking onto frontal targets with enhanced armor piercing and destruction, 7s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.wither_birth_blast=Wither Birth Blast
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_birth_blast=Wither Birth Blast: Channel a 3s invulnerable birth charge that heals your health with a server-wide broadcast rumble, then erupt with a devastating power 7.0 shockwave dealing 25 piercing damage and 15s Wither II with 0 self-damage and no block destruction, 30s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.endermite_burrow=Burrow Leap
morphext.metamorph.desc.endermite_burrow=Burrow Leap: Rapidly dash and leap along the ground through tight spaces with portal dust, gaining 3s Invisibility and Speed II, 3s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.endermite_bite=Parasitic Bite
morphext.metamorph.desc.endermite_bite=Parasitic Bite: Snap at adjacent foes within 2.5m dealing 5 damage with Slowness II and Weakness, siphoning life force to restore 2 HP to yourself, 2.5s cooldown.

# End and Nether Boss Passives
morphext.passive.wither_armor.name=Wither Armor
morphext.passive.wither_armor.desc=Surrounds your body with a swirling white electric aura when at or below 50% HP, deflecting and completely negating 100% of arrows, throwables, and projectiles.
