morphext.passive.morphext.wither_armor.desc=Surrounds your body with a swirling white electric aura when at or below 50% HP, deflecting and completely negating 100% of arrows, throwables, and projectiles.
morphext.passive.enderman_arrow_dodge.name=Arrow Evasion
morphext.passive.enderman_arrow_dodge.desc=Enderman ultimate evasion defense: Completely negates incoming projectile attacks by instantly teleporting to a random safe location, making you impossible to hit with arrows.
morphext.passive.morphext.enderman_arrow_dodge.name=Arrow Evasion
morphext.passive.morphext.enderman_arrow_dodge.desc=Enderman ultimate evasion defense: Completely negates incoming projectile attacks by instantly teleporting to a random safe location, making you impossible to hit with arrows.
morphext.passive.enderman_water_stress.name=Water Stress Teleport
morphext.passive.enderman_water_stress.desc=Takes erosion damage every second in water or rain, triggering an instinctive panic teleport to adjacent dry solid ground.
morphext.passive.morphext.enderman_water_stress.name=Water Stress Teleport
morphext.passive.morphext.enderman_water_stress.desc=Takes erosion damage every second in water or rain, triggering an instinctive panic teleport to adjacent dry solid ground.
morphext.passive.endermite_bait.name=Enderman Bait
morphext.passive.endermite_bait.desc=Emits an irritating void vibration that provokes and forces all Endermen within 24m to focus their attack aggro upon yourself.
