morphext.metamorph.desc.stray_frost_aura=Glacial Aura: Hostile mobs within 5 blocks continuously suffer light slowness; walking on water freezes it temporarily into frosted ice.

morphext.passive.snowman_snow_trail.name=Snow Trail
morphext.passive.snowman_snow_trail.desc=Leaves a layer of snow upon supported blocks as you walk; melts naturally when near hot lava; takes thermal damage every second in hot biomes.
